OL,3,GNEWSA'Our town is safe - prove it needs
OL,4,Aprivate patrols'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA district council leader has hit out
OL,7,Fat new private security patrols, saying
OL,8,Fthey risk "increasing concern or
OL,9,Freinforcing inaccurate perceptions" of
OL,10,Fhis area.
OL,12,FThe patrols have been introduced by
OL,13,FReform UK-led Essex County Council in
OL,14,FBraintree, Colchester and Chelmsford -
OL,15,Ftowns that asylum seekers accommodated
OL,16,Fat nearby MDP Wethersfield frequently
OL,17,Fvisit.
OL,19,FThe council said the initiative was
OL,20,Flaunched in direct response to concerns
OL,21,Fraised by residents and would "deter
OL,22,Fanti-social behaviour".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
