OL,3,GNEWSA'Our town is safe - prove it needs
OL,4,Aprivate patrols'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBraintree District Council's
OL,7,FConservative leader, Tom Cunningham,
OL,8,Fsaid the town was a safe place and
OL,9,Fcalled on the county council to provide
OL,10,Fevidence that patrols were "justified
OL,11,For requested".
